# Raw (model, item) call captures - the spend-control cache ("capture once, math
# off the artifact"). COMMITTED as ground truth: these are the raw answers every
# verdict/finding rests on, so the evidence is self-contained, not reconstructable
# only by grepping a run log. cache/pairwise/ stays ignored (working copies of the
# verdicts already committed under evidence/pairwise-verdicts/); cache-batch/ stays
# ignored (Batch-lane captures - the batch-lane-*.log run logs are the committed
# ground truth for that lane).
cache/pairwise/
cache-batch/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Reports: every run writes a UNIQUE UTC-timestamped file (reports/report-<UTC>.html,
# enforced by tests/conftest.py pytest_configure) so no run can ever overwrite
# another. Those auto files are local-only / ignored; a report given a DESCRIPTIVE
# name (report-findings.html, the full-suite live-run report report-full-live-<date>.html,
# the per-finding evidence reports referenced by findings.json, the guardrail/firewall
# keepers) is committed deliberately. The glob
# matches ONLY the timestamp shape (report-<8 digits>T<6 digits>Z.html), never the
# descriptive names.
reports/report.html
reports/report-????????T??????Z.html

# --- Secrets / local env (NEVER commit - API + Langfuse keys) ----------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

